␀␀␀␀␀yWNàã˜›ΩE␀␀ΩE␀␀␀␀␀content/chatzilla/channels.js/* ***** BEGIN LICENSE BLOCK *****
 * Version: MPL 1.1/GPL 2.0/LGPL 2.1
